From d9438294467006eda7179ce058ced49824f2dfd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: arena-agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 12:19:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sync 6 Crow/field-cipher CyberChef recipes from shdwelf/Html5
 (441 -> 447)

- enigmaM4: Kriegsmarine four-wheel Enigma (stationary Beta/Gamma Greek
  wheel + thin B/C reflector); Beta/A + thin-B == wide UKW-B control (BDZGO)
- secomSchedule: SECOM key-schedule worksheet (official Rijmenants digits)
- odPoemKey: Dutch OD poem-code key/indicator worksheet (EJHQT / OTRGJ)
- secomExact: full SECOM encrypt/decrypt with authoritative triangular
  disruption; reproduces + round-trips the official 105-digit vector; the
  rejected Crow candidate stays rejected
- iocFitness: Friedman IoC, Sigma h^2 integer IoC, English chi^2, bigram
  log-score, Stage-1 calibration rule
- plugboardHillClimb: Sullivan-Weierud / Sylichenko plugboard hill-climb
  over a precomputed step x 26 table; recovers Stecker AI EN OS RT and the
  full 274-letter plaintext in-browser

Method provenance: github.com/asilichenko/enigma (the Crow's first listed
solver; Enigma tooling only, no SECOM code, no Crow solution).

Also: deterministic dist/cyberchef.xdc rebuild, INVENTORY.md row updated,
docs/CROW_FIELD_RECIPES.md added, and a node:test golden-vector harness
(recipes-crow.test.mjs) wired into the verify workflow so these recipes
cannot drift from the Html5 copy silently.
