+/*
+ * node:test harness for the six field-cipher/Crow research recipes synced
+ * from shdwelf/Html5 on 2026-10-02: enigmaM4, secomSchedule, odPoemKey,
+ * secomExact, iocFitness, plugboardHillClimb.
+ *
+ *   node --test webxdc/cyberchef/recipes-crow.test.mjs
+ *
+ * The app's single inline <script> expects a browser, so the sandbox supplies
+ * a permissive DOM stub: every element lookup returns a recording dummy. The
+ * assertions below are the same golden vectors the Html5 repo enforces with
+ * vitest + JSDOM (test/cyberchef-field-museum.test.ts there), so the two
+ * copies of these recipes can never drift apart silently.
+ */
